Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.27,0:00:04.27,Default,,0,0,0,,[METAL THUMPlNG]
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.84,0:01:20.89,Default,,0,0,0,,[♪♪♪]
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.99,0:01:39.74,Default,,0,0,0,,HANK:\NAll right, everybody. Listen up.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.91,0:01:42.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Tuco Salamanca.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.62,0:01:44.50,Default,,0,0,0,,For those of you\Nwho were not with us\Nthis morning
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.67,0:01:46.88,Default,,0,0,0,,we raided his headquarters.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.05,0:01:48.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Also his last-known address.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.09,0:01:53.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Even the little den of iniquity\Nhe keeps for his meth-hag girlfriend.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.38,0:01:55.34,Default,,0,0,0,,We netted a bunch\Nof his lieutenants.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.51,0:01:57.01,Default,,0,0,0,,The big man himself\Nsmelled us coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.43,0:02:01.85,Default,,0,0,0,,So study the face.\NStudy the file.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.02,0:02:04.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Get a big old raging hard-on
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.60,0:02:07.23,Default,,0,0,0,,at the idea of catching\Nthis piece of shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.40,0:02:08.61,Default,,0,0,0,,[PEOPLE CHUCKLE]
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.78,0:02:10.86,Default,,0,0,0,,My apologies\Nto the H.R. department.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.03,0:02:14.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Grow tumescent with anticipation.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.07,0:02:16.65,Default,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.82,0:02:18.78,Default,,0,0,0,,On the hit parade, 1 998.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.95,0:02:20.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Reputed to have whacked\None "Dog" Paulson
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.12,0:02:22.83,Default,,0,0,0,,back when our\Nhomegrown bandidos
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.00,0:02:25.79,Default,,0,0,0,,were wresting the crank trade\Naway from the So Cal biker gangs.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.96,0:02:29.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Also, we' re pretty sure\Nhe knifed a Mexican national in '03.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.59,0:02:33.26,Default,,0,0,0,,And for my money, seeing how\Nhe customarily deals with rivals,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.42,0:02:36.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd say he is a prime suspect\Nin the disappearance
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.26,0:02:38.55,Default,,0,0,0,,of our dearly missed Krazy-8.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.47,0:02:41.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Hats over your heart\Nfor that dirtball.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.89,0:02:43.93,Default,,0,0,0,,We hauled Tuco in\Nfor questioning on that
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.10,0:02:45.64,Default,,0,0,0,,but as usual,\Nwe couldn't make it stick.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.81,0:02:48.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, he runs a tight ship.\NSmug bastard.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.36,0:02:52.57,Default,,0,0,0,,And even worse,\NEl Paso says he' s got\Nsome kind of cartel connection.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.28,0:02:55.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, yeah. I know it's...\NWe all know what's going on\Ndown there.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.16,0:02:58.00,Default,,0,0,0,,We sure as hell don' t want it\Ngoing on up here,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.16,0:03:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,which brings us to the good news.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.16,0:03:04.71,Default,,0,0,0,,We finally got some actual,\Nhonest-to-God evidence.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.33,0:03:08.79,Default,,0,0,0,,This is one of Tuco's henchmen.\NStreet name: No-Doze.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.96,0:03:12.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Found him tucked in the junkyard\Nalong with Tuco's own brother-in-law,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.67,0:03:14.34,Default,,0,0,0,,a.k.a. Gonzo.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.51,0:03:19.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Gonzo, this rocket scientist,\Nwas moving No-Doze's body--
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.18,0:03:21.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Either hiding it there\Nor pulling it out.\NWe' re still not sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.76,0:03:25.26,Default,,0,0,0,,--when he got his arm\Ncrushed clean off.\NHeh, heh.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.44,0:03:28.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyone wanna see the photos,\Nthey' re on my website.\NHilarious.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.69,0:03:30.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyway. The upshot is
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.86,0:03:36.24,Default,,0,0,0,,we got us a nice, big, juicy,\Nbloody fingerprint
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.40,0:03:39.86,Default,,0,0,0,,which belongs to\NSeñor Tuco.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.20,0:03:43.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Christmas came early\Nto the Schrader household.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.83,0:03:47.33,Default,,0,0,0,,That is,\Nprovided we find this guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.00,0:03:50.84,Default,,0,0,0,,So to all present, I ask you,\Nyou wanna find this guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.00,0:03:53.54,Default,,0,0,0,,MAN 1 : Yes.\NMAN 2: Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.71,0:03:55.17,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell was that? Jesus.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.13,0:03:57.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Wanna try that again?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.05,0:04:01.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you wanna find this guy?\NAGENTS: Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.47,0:04:04.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Are we going to find this guy?\NAGENTS: Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.22,0:04:05.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Louder, damn it!\NAGENTS: Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.73,0:04:07.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Give me a "hell, yeah!"\NAGENTS: Hell, yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.85,0:04:09.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Hell, yeah!\NAGENTS: Hell, yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.77,0:04:13.31,Default,,0,0,0,,ALL [CHANTlNG]:\NHell, yeah. Hell, yeah, Hell, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.90,0:04:19.40,Default,,0,0,0,,They ain't gonna find him.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.57,0:04:21.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Guy is in México by now.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.99,0:04:25.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Appearances, Gomey.\NTsk, tsk.\NIt's all about appearances.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.75,0:04:29.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen, l gotta take\Nsome personal time.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.75,0:04:31.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, in the middle of a manhunt?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.75,0:04:36.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Skyler called last night.\NIt's Walt. He' s missing.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.42,0:04:39.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Just disappeared from the house,\Nand no one's heard from him since.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.76,0:04:42.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn. You don't think he...?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.85,0:04:46.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Holler if you need me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.52,0:04:49.44,Default,,0,0,0,,All right.\NThanks a lot, man.\NAppreciate that.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.26,0:06:05.68,Default,,0,0,0,,SKYLER:\NThis is the most recent photo.\NWe haven't taken many lately, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.89,0:06:10.02,Default,,0,0,0,,But that's what\Nhe looks like now.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.43,0:06:12.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Without the hair.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.60,0:06:13.64,Default,,0,0,0,,[DOOR OPENS]
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.81,0:06:16.48,Default,,0,0,0,,HANK:\NHey, it's me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.02,0:06:20.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Tim.\NReally appreciate you\Nsparing us your day off.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.36,0:06:22.82,Default,,0,0,0,,No worries.\NHappy to help.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.99,0:06:25.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, this is helpful.\NGood.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.45,0:06:27.87,Default,,0,0,0,,What about height and weight?\NFive eleven,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.03,0:06:30.20,Default,,0,0,0,,most recently, about 1 70.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.70,0:06:34.83,Default,,0,0,0,,One sixty-five.\NThat's what l weigh.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.00,0:06:37.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess he weighs\Na little less.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.04,0:06:41.33,Default,,0,0,0,,That's fine.\NThat's close enough.\NGood.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.51,0:06:43.89,Default,,0,0,0,,What about other\Ndistinguishing features?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.05,0:06:46.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Tattoos or moles or scars?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.55,0:06:51.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Anything that might help us.\NTattoos? No. Not really. No.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.23,0:06:53.65,Default,,0,0,0,,That's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.81,0:06:55.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that the list of medications?\NYes.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.85,0:06:58.39,Default,,0,0,0,,I wrote them all down.\NAnd there's no drug interactions.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.56,0:07:02.31,Default,,0,0,0,,None that are listed.\NI called his doctor, so, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.57,0:07:05.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Has he been depressed?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.58,0:07:15.00,Default,,0,0,0,,He's, um, been withdrawn lately.\NA little withdrawn.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.71,0:07:16.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.92,0:07:21.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Last night, he was, uh, agitated.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.59,0:07:22.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Agitated?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.92,0:07:27.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.\NWhen he came home last night,\Nhe was agitated, upset.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.59,0:07:28.72,Default,,0,0,0,,TIM:\NUpset in general?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.89,0:07:31.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Or upset because\Nof something particular?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.35,0:07:33.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.93,0:07:40.10,Default,,0,0,0,,When I asked him\Nwhat was wrong,\Nhe said:
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.27,0:07:42.85,Default,,0,0,0,,"I don't know where to begin."
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.19,0:07:46.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Then he just walked\Nout of the room--\NOut of the bathroom.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.11,0:07:48.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I was in the tub,\NI was taking a bath.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.95,0:07:52.04,Default,,0,0,0,,--and when l came out\Nabout 1 0 minutes later,\Nhe was gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.99,0:07:54.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Nothing else missing?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.08,0:08:00.04,Default,,0,0,0,,His keys, wallet, cell phone.\NJust what was on him.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.54,0:08:03.92,Default,,0,0,0,,But-- What about the phone call?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.05,0:08:07.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh-- I' m looking into it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.13,0:08:11.59,Default,,0,0,0,,What phone call?\NWalt's cell phone rang.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.76,0:08:16.14,Default,,0,0,0,,He pulled it out,\Nlooked at it,\Nand didn't answer it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.31,0:08:17.64,Default,,0,0,0,,But then, a short time after,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.81,0:08:19.98,Default,,0,0,0,,he wandered\Nout of the bathroom.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.15,0:08:21.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.15,0:08:24.03,Default,,0,0,0,,couldn't that be, uh,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.19,0:08:26.11,Default,,0,0,0,,important, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.91,0:08:31.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Anything else\Nyou can think of?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.70,0:08:34.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Anything else. Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.66,0:08:36.83,Default,,0,0,0,,No. I called\Nthe credit card providers,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.00,0:08:42.17,Default,,0,0,0,,and there's no report\Nof any recent activity.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.34,0:08:46.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I-- Let' s see.\NI checked with every hospital\Nwithin 50 miles.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.88,0:08:49.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Every police station.\NEvery morgue.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.18,0:08:51.89,Default,,0,0,0,,So, no, I really don't--\NI don't have anything else.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.05,0:08:55.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I was actually hoping\Nthat you had something else,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.77,0:08:58.31,Default,,0,0,0,,being that you're the expert.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.61,0:09:04.15,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.32,0:09:05.70,Default,,0,0,0,,No worries.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.86,0:09:07.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I think this is\Ngood enough to start.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.90,0:09:09.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Gives us plenty to work on.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.57,0:09:14.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Mrs. White.\NThank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.53,0:09:16.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Walter.\NThank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.92,0:09:30.05,Default,,0,0,0,,So that cell-phone call\Nshe' s talking about?\NI ran it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.22,0:09:32.18,Default,,0,0,0,,And?\NNever happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.34,0:09:33.84,Default,,0,0,0,,No record of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.01,0:09:36.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Second cell phone.\NYeah. l'm thinking.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.42,0:10:08.42,Default,,0,0,0,,[THUMPlNG ON METAL]
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.56,0:10:28.69,Default,,0,0,0,,[MAN GRUNTING]
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.11,0:10:36.11,Default,,0,0,0,,[♪♪♪]
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.42,0:10:48.42,Default,,0,0,0,,[COUGHlNG]
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.28,0:11:17.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.08,0:11:21.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Out.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.66,0:11:23.83,Default,,0,0,0,,JESSE:\NGet away from me!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.00,0:11:26.00,Default,,0,0,0,,[JESSE GRUNTING]
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.58,0:11:29.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Settle down, bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.17,0:11:33.51,Default,,0,0,0,,JESSE:\NYou gonna shoot me, huh?\NShoot me in here!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.67,0:11:36.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope I bleed like a mother too!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.18,0:11:38.26,Default,,0,0,0,,That way, you have to clean it up!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.35,0:11:41.35,Default,,0,0,0,,[GASPING AND PANTING]
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.26,0:11:43.64,Default,,0,0,0,,It's your ride, retard.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.81,0:11:45.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I ain't gotta clean jack.\NNow get out.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.11,0:12:00.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Get up.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.63,0:12:11.26,Default,,0,0,0,,JESSE:\NOh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.42,0:12:13.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't do this, Tuco.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.41,0:12:42.41,Default,,0,0,0,,[THE WALKMEN'S\N"RED MOON" PLAYS]
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.30,0:13:40.30,Default,,0,0,0,,No more posters?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.97,0:13:43.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Walter Jr.'s making more.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.31,0:13:49.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Marie.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.15,0:13:55.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't think\Nhe'll hurt himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.07,0:13:59.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, he just\Ndoesn't strike me\Nas the type.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.82,0:14:01.49,Default,,0,0,0,,He'll turn up.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.66,0:14:11.24,Default,,0,0,0,,[MARlE SIGHS]
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.41,0:14:13.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, the whole tiara thing,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.00,0:14:17.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I just find it bewildering that\NMarie.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.75,0:14:20.67,Default,,0,0,0,,you didn't believe that--\NMarie.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.68,0:14:24.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Not now.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.71,0:15:00.71,Default,,0,0,0,,[MAN SPEAKlNG IN SPANlSH\NON TV]
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.22,0:15:11.22,Default,,0,0,0,,[SPEAKING IN SPANISH]
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.56,0:15:59.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Empty your pockets.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.09,0:16:30.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Thought your name\Nwas Heisenberg,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.80,0:16:33.47,Default,,0,0,0,,"Walter Hartwell White."
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.64,0:16:36.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Heisenberg is kind of\Na pseudonym.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.19,0:16:41.65,Default,,0,0,0,,You know, a business name.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.15,0:16:50.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.28,0:16:58.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I like doing business\Nwith a family man.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.62,0:17:01.00,Default,,0,0,0,,There's always\Na lot of collateral.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.17,0:17:11.17,Default,,0,0,0,,[TUCO LAUGHlNG]
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.16,0:17:38.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Answer me one thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.33,0:17:43.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Can I trust you?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.38,0:17:47.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes. Yes, absolutely.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.68,0:17:59.64,Default,,0,0,0,,TUCO:\NSit down.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.40,0:18:10.28,Default,,0,0,0,,DEA...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.24,0:18:14.74,Default,,0,0,0,,hit my place of business\Nthis morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.91,0:18:17.16,Default,,0,0,0,,About a hundred cops\Nlooking for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.66,0:18:20.24,Default,,0,0,0,,You two haven't\Nbeen talking, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.41,0:18:23.50,Default,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.42,0:18:28.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Picked up my whole crew,\Ntop to bottom.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.92,0:18:31.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Everybody except Gonzo.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.01,0:18:34.09,Default,,0,0,0,,That's weird, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.26,0:18:37.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, don' t you think\Nthat that's weird?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.93,0:18:40.68,Default,,0,0,0,,It's weird. Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.85,0:18:44.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Unusual.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.73,0:18:50.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Last two days,\NI couldn't get Gonzo\Non the phone.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.03,0:18:55.28,Default,,0,0,0,,He's been acting all pouty\Non account of No-Doze.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.95,0:18:58.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Explain to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.45,0:19:04.29,Default,,0,0,0,,How is it my fault that\Nthat little bitch\Ndid not know his place?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.13,0:19:13.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I saw this coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.47,0:19:16.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I can see the future, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.09,0:19:21.80,Default,,0,0,0,,It's this gift that I have\Ndeep inside my head.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.81,0:19:26.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I knew last night they were\Ngonna come try and bust me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.10,0:19:28.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Gonzo.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.48,0:19:32.90,Default,,0,0,0,,He went and snitched\Nto the cops!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.07,0:19:35.74,Default,,0,0,0,,That lousy son of a bitch!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.45,0:19:42.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I trusted him like a brother!\NI was good to him!\NI was good!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.83,0:19:46.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I see Gonzo,\NI'm gonna gut him,\NI'm gonna skin him,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.62,0:19:50.16,Default,,0,0,0,,and l'm gonna stuff his hide\Nfor a heavy bag,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.34,0:19:54.51,Default,,0,0,0,,and every time I hit him,\Nit' s going to be like\Na lesson to myself!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.67,0:19:58.76,Default,,0,0,0,,You never,\Nnever trust the people\Nthat you love!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.02,0:20:10.98,Default,,0,0,0,,So you plan to ice Gonzo,\Nlike, future tense?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.98,0:20:13.11,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.11,0:20:16.45,Default,,0,0,0,,You' re saying, Tuco...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.61,0:20:19.45,Default,,0,0,0,,You' re saying that Gonzo
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.61,0:20:24.03,Default,,0,0,0,,is currently operating\Nas a police informant
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.20,0:20:25.37,Default,,0,0,0,,as far as you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.54,0:20:31.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm very sorry to hear that.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.21,0:20:34.09,Default,,0,0,0,,That's disappointing.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.50,0:20:35.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.88,0:20:38.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd waste him too, yo.\NShut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.05,0:20:40.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.89,0:20:43.56,Default,,0,0,0,,They' re out there\Nlooking for me right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.72,0:20:46.56,Default,,0,0,0,,They got ghetto birds\Nand black ops.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.73,0:20:50.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I need to get high. Oh, fu--\NI need to get good and high.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.73,0:20:55.19,Default,,0,0,0,,[GRUNTS]
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.40,0:20:58.86,Default,,0,0,0,,What's with this gak?\NIt smells like headcheese.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.61,0:21:03.11,Default,,0,0,0,,No, it' s, uh-- It' s killer.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.49,0:21:04.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, seriously.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.25,0:21:12.42,Default,,0,0,0,,So l was thinking\Nlast night.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.58,0:21:14.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I came up with\Nthis great idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.21,0:21:17.59,Default,,0,0,0,,México.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.34,0:21:19.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Mexico?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.55,0:21:23.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Ha, ha.\NWe' ll disappear\Nway out in the jungle.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.35,0:21:25.14,Default,,0,0,0,,We' ll set you up in a superlab.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.31,0:21:27.85,Default,,0,0,0,,We' ll do nothing but cook 24/7.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.02,0:21:29.94,Default,,0,0,0,,And no Federales\Nare gonna mess with us
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.10,0:21:32.35,Default,,0,0,0,,because l got my people there.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.52,0:21:34.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Connections.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.98,0:21:38.78,Default,,0,0,0,,We' re going to make\Nbeaucoup bucks,\NHeisenberg, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.94,0:21:41.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Tuco, I...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.53,0:21:43.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I have a wife and family.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.12,0:21:47.29,Default,,0,0,0,,So what?\NYou' ll get another one.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.45,0:21:51.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't want you to take\Nthis the wrong way,\Nbut I can't just
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.71,0:21:54.13,Default,,0,0,0,,uproot my life like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.29,0:21:56.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, man.\NI mean, me neither.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.30,0:22:01.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Who's talking to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.51,0:22:07.43,Default,,0,0,0,,JESSE:\NYou need me, man,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.60,0:22:10.81,Default,,0,0,0,,because l cooked that scante\Nin your hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.35,0:22:15.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.31,0:22:16.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll tell you something, yo.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.11,0:22:19.99,Default,,0,0,0,,You never tried nothing like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.15,0:22:22.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Stink or no stink,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.49,0:22:26.99,Default,,0,0,0,,one bump,\Nyou' ll be flying high for days.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.95,0:22:32.66,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a new product him\Nand l've been working up.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.83,0:22:35.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Careful when you hit it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.38,0:22:38.26,Default,,0,0,0,,It kicks like a 1 2 gauge\Nwhen it comes on.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.00,0:22:40.33,Default,,0,0,0,,[CHUCKLES]
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.47,0:22:43.85,Default,,0,0,0,,It's got a\Nsecret ingredient.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.09,0:22:47.63,Default,,0,0,0,,What secret ingredient?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.72,0:22:50.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Chili powder.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.86,0:22:59.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I hate chili powder.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.28,0:23:06.32,Default,,0,0,0,,This blue magic, this is money.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.99,0:23:10.62,Default,,0,0,0,,You keep cooking this,\NHeisenberg.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.37,0:23:17.37,Default,,0,0,0,,We' re gonna rewrite\Nhistory with this.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.54,0:23:19.46,Default,,0,0,0,,[GRUNTS\NTHEN LAUGHS]
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.13,0:23:26.22,Default,,0,0,0,,All right. Time to clean\Nthe menudo out from\Nbetween your ears.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.84,0:23:30.34,Default,,0,0,0,,No, no, no. No,\NI need him, Tuco.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.51,0:23:32.55,Default,,0,0,0,,I need him very, very badly.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.98,0:23:36.06,Default,,0,0,0,,He's my partner.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.35,0:23:41.35,Default,,0,0,0,,And if he doesn' t go,\NI don't go.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.53,0:23:46.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll tell you this.\NMy cousins are driving\Nup here right now
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.91,0:23:49.75,Default,,0,0,0,,to smuggle us back down,\Nand they're gonna be here\Nby sunset
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.91,0:23:50.99,Default,,0,0,0,,and you're gonna be\Non that truck,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.16,0:23:53.41,Default,,0,0,0,,or you're gonna be dead!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.37,0:23:56.95,Default,,0,0,0,,And you...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.25,0:24:01.17,Default,,0,0,0,,You better hope they got room\Nin the trunk.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.73,0:24:18.44,Default,,0,0,0,,SKYLER:\NWhere are you going?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.60,0:24:20.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Louis is taking me\Nto the train station.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.94,0:24:22.73,Default,,0,0,0,,We' ll put these up.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.90,0:24:26.95,Default,,0,0,0,,No, no, honey. No, l'll do it.\NHe wants to help, let him help.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.11,0:24:30.57,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean,\Nhow long has it been\Nsince you' ve slept?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.49,0:24:34.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, she's right, Sky.\NWhy don' t you lay down\Na while?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.50,0:24:38.54,Default,,0,0,0,,For Christ sake,\Nyou got a bun in the oven.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.79,0:24:41.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I got my cell if you need me.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.21,0:24:43.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay?\NSKYLER: Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.71,0:24:48.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Bye, sweetie. I' ll see you later.\NWALT JR.: All right. Bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.09,0:24:55.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Actually, I think the very fact\Nthey haven't found him yet
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.02,0:24:57.90,Default,,0,0,0,,bodes well.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.98,0:25:03.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, l mean, if he--\NYou know.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.36,0:25:07.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Somebody would' ve\Nsmelled something by now.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.15,0:25:10.23,Default,,0,0,0,,There's got to be\Nsomething.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.41,0:25:12.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Some detail that\Nwe haven't picked up on.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.33,0:25:16.92,Default,,0,0,0,,What about the second cell phone?\NAh, Jesus.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.08,0:25:20.75,Default,,0,0,0,,What?\NWe can't just ignore\Na potential clue, Hank.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.17,0:25:24.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.\NWhat are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.84,0:25:32.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, the call you said Walt got\Nbefore he disappeared?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.84,0:25:35.18,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no record of it\Nwith the phone company.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.85,0:25:38.14,Default,,0,0,0,,No incoming,\Nno dropped calls,\Nnothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.31,0:25:40.39,Default,,0,0,0,,But his phone rang.\NI heard it.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.56,0:25:46.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Um, all right.\NWell, then if that's the case,\Nhe must have a second phone.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.03,0:25:51.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Wh-- Why?\NWhat sense would\Nthere be in that?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.78,0:25:54.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah. All right. Okay.\NI'm not here to argue with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.37,0:26:00.62,Default,,0,0,0,,No, Hank.\NYou can't just bring up secret\Ncell phone and then drop it.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.79,0:26:02.87,Default,,0,0,0,,What does it mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.04,0:26:05.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know, Sky.\NWhat do you want me to say?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.71,0:26:09.55,Default,,0,0,0,,It means Walt has a secret.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.71,0:26:13.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone's got one from somebody,\Nbig or little.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.55,0:26:18.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay. Oh, wow. Everyone. Okay.\NSkyler, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.89,0:26:22.85,Default,,0,0,0,,He kept cancer\Nfrom you for weeks.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.60,0:26:28.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, then, let's assume\Nthere's a second cell phone.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.86,0:26:31.32,Default,,0,0,0,,So what?\NWhat, is he having an affair?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.95,0:26:33.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Walt? Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.20,0:26:39.66,Default,,0,0,0,,What about the marijuana?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.08,0:26:43.87,Default,,0,0,0,,He's not on pot anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.04,0:26:46.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Says who? Him?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.25,0:26:48.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Chemotherapy and\Nmarijuana go together
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.59,0:26:52.55,Default,,0,0,0,,like apple pie\Nand Chevrolet.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.72,0:26:57.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe he' s addicted\Nto the pot
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.60,0:26:59.69,Default,,0,0,0,,and he owes\Nhis drug dealer\Na lot of money.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.85,0:27:02.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Marie, you don't\Nget hooked on pot\Nlike that.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.14,0:27:06.14,Default,,0,0,0,,How do you know?\NYou didn't even know he\Nhad a second cell phone.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.48,0:27:11.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Hank, you have to question\Nthis drug-dealer person.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.28,0:27:12.91,Default,,0,0,0,,He may know something.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.28,0:27:22.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, l'm telling you,\Nwe're grasping at straws here.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.50,0:27:26.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Then grasp.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.84,0:27:37.63,Default,,0,0,0,,HANK:\NExcuse me, ma' am.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.55,0:27:41.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Hi, l'm looking for Jesse.\NHe around?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.52,0:27:44.31,Default,,0,0,0,,No. I'm afraid not.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.48,0:27:47.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Why?\NI'm sorry. Hank Schrader.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.60,0:27:52.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm actually hoping\Nto talk to Jesse about\Nmy brother-in-law, Walter White.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.23,0:27:55.48,Default,,0,0,0,,He taught your son\Nchemistry in high school.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.65,0:27:59.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, Mr. White.\NYes, l remember him.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.20,0:28:01.87,Default,,0,0,0,,That was a long time ago.\NYes, ma'am.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.04,0:28:05.75,Default,,0,0,0,,It's my understanding\Nthat he and Jesse,\Nthey' ve stayed in touch.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.66,0:28:08.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Really?\NYeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.92,0:28:09.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.63,0:28:14.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr. White must' ve seen\Nsome potential in Jesse.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.63,0:28:17.01,Default,,0,0,0,,He really tried\Nto motivate him.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.18,0:28:19.60,Default,,0,0,0,,He was one of the\Nfew teachers who cared.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.76,0:28:21.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, Walt's that way.\NHe's a good man.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.35,0:28:24.35,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so sorry to hear\Nabout his illness.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:24.52,0:28:26.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Please pass along\Nour best wishes.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.35,0:28:29.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I certainly will,\Nas soon as he turns up.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.90,0:28:31.15,Default,,0,0,0,,He's missing, actually.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.07,0:28:33.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Just kind of walked off, or...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.94,0:28:37.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyway, which is why\NI'm going around,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.28,0:28:39.95,Default,,0,0,0,,trying to think of anyone\Nwho knows him, even slightly.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.11,0:28:41.86,Default,,0,0,0,,That's terrible.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.03,0:28:44.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Anything we can do to help.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.54,0:28:47.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, if you could put me\Nin touch with your son...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.71,0:28:50.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Like l said,\Nwe're kind of desperate for leads.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.96,0:28:53.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Jesse's not answering either\Nphone number I have for him,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.17,0:28:55.05,Default,,0,0,0,,and no one seems to be home\Nat his house.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.21,0:28:59.38,Default,,0,0,0,,And why do you think my son\Nand Mr. White would be in touch?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.59,0:29:03.55,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't necessarily.\NI just, um--
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.72,0:29:05.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you with the police?\NNo, ma'am. Not at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.06,0:29:13.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm with the\NDrug Enforcement Administration.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.73,0:29:15.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.28,0:29:16.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Is my son in trouble?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:16.57,0:29:19.07,Default,,0,0,0,,I have absolutely no reason\Nto think that, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.24,0:29:21.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Do I need to get a lawyer?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.95,0:29:24.58,Default,,0,0,0,,You know, you don't seem\Nvery forthright about this,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:24.74,0:29:27.20,Default,,0,0,0,,coming here and\Nasking questions\Nabout my son and--
Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.37,0:29:29.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Mrs. Pinkman, I swear to you,\NI'm not here on official capacity.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:30.00,0:29:33.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I do not care what your son may\Nor may not have done wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.88,0:29:35.67,Default,,0,0,0,,I just wanna find\Nmy brother-in-law.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:36.71,0:29:40.92,Default,,0,0,0,,His wife is worried sick,\Nand she's got a baby\Non the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.30,0:29:44.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.\NI would like to help you,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:45.14,0:29:47.68,Default,,0,0,0,,but I have not seen my son\Nin over a month.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.85,0:29:51.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't expect to see him\Nanytime soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:52.56,0:29:56.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, thanks for your time.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:58.32,0:29:59.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.28,0:30:02.45,Default,,0,0,0,,If you could tell me\None more thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.61,0:30:07.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Is Jesse still driving the\N'89 Chevy Monte Carlo,\Nas far as you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.87,0:30:12.67,Default,,0,0,0,,If he had spent half\Nas much time and money\Non his education
Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.83,0:30:17.08,Default,,0,0,0,,as he has on that\Nridiculous bouncing car...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.46,0:30:20.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Low rider, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.80,0:30:23.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Gomey, hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.43,0:30:26.31,Default,,0,0,0,,No, nothing yet. Hey, listen,\Ndo me a solid and check out
Dialogue: 0,0:30:26.47,0:30:28.60,Default,,0,0,0,,a '89 Chevy Monte Carlo
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.77,0:30:33.23,Default,,0,0,0,,registered to a one\NJesse Pinkman.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.39,0:30:36.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Specifically, l wanna know\Nif the car' s got a LoJack.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:36.73,0:30:40.32,Default,,0,0,0,,It's one of those jack-off low riders,\Nso l'm betting it' s got a good shot\Nthat there is.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:40.49,0:30:43.87,Default,,0,0,0,,If so, can you go ahead\Nand get me a fix on it?\NThanks, buddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.58,0:30:56.58,Default,,0,0,0,,[MAN & WOMAN SPEAKlNG\NIN SPANISH ON TV]
Dialogue: 0,0:31:02.55,0:31:04.55,Default,,0,0,0,,[GRUNTlNG]
Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.77,0:31:12.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Chili powder.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:13.18,0:31:16.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Did I not already tell you\Nhow moronic that was?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.02,0:31:18.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Whatever, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:18.56,0:31:20.35,Default,,0,0,0,,At least\NI tried something.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:20.53,0:31:22.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, it almost worked too.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.65,0:31:25.78,Default,,0,0,0,,How's about\Nyou leaving my gun, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.95,0:31:28.83,Default,,0,0,0,,First you boost it, then\Nyou leave it in your house.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:28.99,0:31:30.70,Default,,0,0,0,,My gun.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.91,0:31:37.54,Default,,0,0,0,,How was l supposed to know\Nyou were chauffeuring Tuco\Nto my doorstep?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.71,0:31:40.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, at least\Nhe wants you alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:41.09,0:31:43.09,Default,,0,0,0,,[NEWSCASTER SPEAKING\NIN SPANISH ON TV]
Dialogue: 0,0:31:50.56,0:31:52.56,Default,,0,0,0,,[MAN SINGlNG AND\NMUSIC PLAYING ON TV]
Dialogue: 0,0:32:15.41,0:32:16.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, I don't get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:16.91,0:32:19.95,Default,,0,0,0,,If Tuco didn't kill Gonzo,\Nthen who did?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:20.13,0:32:24.43,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:25.88,0:32:27.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Does it really matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:27.88,0:32:31.88,Default,,0,0,0,,If he finds out that\NGonzo is dead and\Nnot a police informant,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:32.06,0:32:34.19,Default,,0,0,0,,who does he\Nautomatically blame?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:34.35,0:32:36.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Us.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:38.94,0:32:40.61,Default,,0,0,0,,We need a plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.77,0:32:46.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Think, think.\NLet's just bum-rush him, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:46.28,0:32:48.57,Default,,0,0,0,,You know,\Nyou crack him over\Nthe head with something,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:48.74,0:32:50.62,Default,,0,0,0,,and l'll go for his gun.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:50.78,0:32:51.99,Default,,0,0,0,,[THUD]
Dialogue: 0,0:32:55.37,0:32:58.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Crack him over the head\Nwith something?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:01.54,0:33:04.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, you got the C-bomb,\Nman, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:04.46,0:33:06.17,Default,,0,0,0,,You' re as good\Nas checked out already.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:06.34,0:33:10.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay? You should be,\Nlike, all sacrificial,\Njumping on a grenade, yo.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:10.64,0:33:12.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Just...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:14.47,0:33:17.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, so my life\Nis not the priority here
Dialogue: 0,0:33:17.39,0:33:19.98,Default,,0,0,0,,because l'm gonna be\Ndead soon anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:20.14,0:33:21.64,Default,,0,0,0,,That's your point?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:21.81,0:33:24.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:51.84,0:33:54.88,Default,,0,0,0,,We gotta get him to take this.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:55.05,0:33:57.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, he don't much like\Nthe taste of chili P.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:57.64,0:33:59.52,Default,,0,0,0,,That much\Nhas been established.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:59.68,0:34:02.68,Default,,0,0,0,,So unless\Nyou can convince him\Nto booty bump...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:08.03,0:34:11.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Eat. We got a long ride\Nahead of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:23.21,0:34:25.17,Default,,0,0,0,,[SPEAKING IN SPANISH]
Dialogue: 0,0:34:29.80,0:34:32.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Go on, sit.\NYou' re looking a little weak,\NHeisenberg.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:32.63,0:34:35.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't want you to go belly up\Nbefore we get there.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:15.43,0:35:17.26,Default,,0,0,0,,TUCO:\NTake it easy, Tio.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:17.76,0:35:21.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I will feed you.\NI eat first. That' s the deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:29.73,0:35:31.44,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:35.61,0:35:37.61,Default,,0,0,0,,[LAUGHING]
Dialogue: 0,0:35:39.16,0:35:41.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I get it, I get it, I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:41.29,0:35:45.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, you greedy old bastard.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:45.71,0:35:47.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I tell you, Heisenberg.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:49.79,0:35:51.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Old people.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:52.26,0:35:53.97,Default,,0,0,0,,You feed them, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:54.13,0:35:56.80,Default,,0,0,0,,You put them\Nin a really nice crib\Nin the country,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:56.97,0:36:00.39,Default,,0,0,0,,and yet they gotta steal\Nthe food off your plate.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:00.81,0:36:03.85,Default,,0,0,0,,You better eat every bite of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:27.29,0:36:29.83,Default,,0,0,0,,TUCO:\NWhat did you do that for?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:30.00,0:36:31.96,Default,,0,0,0,,God!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:36.59,0:36:38.59,Default,,0,0,0,,[TUCO SPEAKING lN SPANlSH]
Dialogue: 0,0:37:11.54,0:37:12.79,Default,,0,0,0,,[RAPlD GUNFIRE]
Dialogue: 0,0:37:15.34,0:37:18.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Ha, ha, ha. Shh.\NHey, look. Look.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:18.72,0:37:20.39,Default,,0,0,0,,There's nothing left.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:20.55,0:37:22.09,Default,,0,0,0,,[BELL DINGlNG]
Dialogue: 0,0:37:33.36,0:37:34.53,Default,,0,0,0,,[TUCO GRUNTS]
Dialogue: 0,0:37:46.79,0:37:50.46,Default,,0,0,0,,What?\NWhat do you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:56.63,0:37:58.13,Default,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:58.30,0:38:01.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't even tell me\Nthat you' re hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:01.76,0:38:03.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't go there.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:14.86,0:38:16.19,Default,,0,0,0,,[LAUGHS]
Dialogue: 0,0:38:16.36,0:38:18.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you mad-dogging them, Tio?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:20.44,0:38:23.28,Default,,0,0,0,,What, you don't like them?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:25.62,0:38:26.62,Default,,0,0,0,,One ding.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:26.78,0:38:30.20,Default,,0,0,0,,That means yes.\NTio don't like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:34.63,0:38:37.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Why don' t you like them, Tio?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:40.51,0:38:42.64,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't trust them?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:49.35,0:38:54.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Why don' t you trust them, Tio?\NTuco, come on. He's...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:55.10,0:38:58.81,Default,,0,0,0,,There clearly some dementia.\NHe's not lucid.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:58.98,0:39:00.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Shh.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:12.16,0:39:13.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Did they do something\Nto you, Tio?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:17.75,0:39:19.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Something that you don't like?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:26.51,0:39:30.51,Default,,0,0,0,,What did they do to you?\NWhat did you do to my tio?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:30.68,0:39:32.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Nothing. Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:32.18,0:39:34.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Bullshit! My tio does not lie!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:34.31,0:39:37.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know.\NI swear.\NI don't know. l--
Dialogue: 0,0:39:37.19,0:39:42.03,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I-- Maybe it was--\NI did change the channel\Non his TV, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:42.19,0:39:44.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that's it.\NWhile you were cooking,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:44.65,0:39:48.20,Default,,0,0,0,,he was watching\None of those, um--\NThose telenovels
Dialogue: 0,0:39:48.37,0:39:51.04,Default,,0,0,0,,with all those ripe honeys on it.\NHe was really into it.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:51.20,0:39:52.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I told you not to\Nchange the channel, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:53.08,0:39:56.12,Default,,0,0,0,,You know,\Ndude needs his eye candy.\NThat's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:57.83,0:39:59.71,Default,,0,0,0,,[LAUGHING]
Dialogue: 0,0:40:00.71,0:40:02.04,Default,,0,0,0,,[SPEAKS IN SPANISH]
Dialogue: 0,0:40:03.59,0:40:08.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that it, Tio?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:10.05,0:40:11.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Did they change your mamitas?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:20.65,0:40:22.82,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you telling me, Tio?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:23.53,0:40:24.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:25.57,0:40:26.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Are they punking me?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:42.21,0:40:44.71,Default,,0,0,0,,JESSE:\NHey. No.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:44.88,0:40:48.34,Default,,0,0,0,,No, man. No.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:48.51,0:40:50.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Come here! Aah!\NNo.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:50.18,0:40:53.77,Default,,0,0,0,,No, no, Tuco.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:57.10,0:40:59.10,Default,,0,0,0,,[JESSE GRUNTING]
Dialogue: 0,0:41:00.56,0:41:03.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Tuco, no. Tuco.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:07.40,0:41:09.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Tuco.\NShut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:21.79,0:41:25.75,Default,,0,0,0,,No. Please, no. God.\NPlease, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:25.92,0:41:28.46,Default,,0,0,0,,No, God.\NI don't wanna die.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:28.63,0:41:30.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell me what you did,\NWalter!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:30.80,0:41:34.14,Default,,0,0,0,,JESSE:\NJesus, I don't wanna die.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:34.81,0:41:38.10,Default,,0,0,0,,No!\NTell me what you did!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:43.81,0:41:46.19,Default,,0,0,0,,We tried to poison you.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:47.74,0:41:49.91,Default,,0,0,0,,We tried to poison you,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:51.66,0:41:55.83,Default,,0,0,0,,because you're an insane,\Ndegenerate piece of filth,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:55.99,0:41:57.99,Default,,0,0,0,,and you deserve to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:00.75,0:42:02.46,Default,,0,0,0,,[GRUNTlNG]
Dialogue: 0,0:42:24.10,0:42:26.10,Default,,0,0,0,,[SCREAMlNG]
Dialogue: 0,0:42:40.75,0:42:42.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Who's the bitch now?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:52.88,0:42:54.21,Default,,0,0,0,,[GROANING]
Dialogue: 0,0:42:58.51,0:43:00.51,Default,,0,0,0,,[CRYING]
Dialogue: 0,0:43:03.27,0:43:05.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Let him bleed.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:24.21,0:43:25.92,Default,,0,0,0,,The keys.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:26.88,0:43:28.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Tuco.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:29.25,0:43:30.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:32.80,0:43:34.43,Default,,0,0,0,,WALT:\NThe cousins?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:34.59,0:43:36.59,Default,,0,0,0,,[♪♪♪]
Dialogue: 0,0:44:00.83,0:44:02.83,Default,,0,0,0,,[TUCO GRUNTING]
Dialogue: 0,0:44:31.32,0:44:32.65,Default,,0,0,0,,JESSE:\NWhat the hell is going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:44.41,0:44:46.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Jesse Pinkman.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:47.04,0:44:49.29,Default,,0,0,0,,You' re a hard man to find.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:57.34,0:44:59.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:11.02,0:45:12.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:29.47,0:46:31.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:33.60,0:46:36.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, God. Hank.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:36.98,0:46:38.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Who?\NHank.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:38.61,0:46:40.03,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:40.19,0:46:41.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, my God.\NWhat?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:42.11,0:46:45.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, my God.\NStay. What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:09.47,0:47:11.72,Default,,0,0,0,,[BELL DINGlNG]
Dialogue: 0,0:47:18.86,0:47:20.86,Default,,0,0,0,,[♪♪♪]
